ngineRoom5.png", "id": "397854095192936", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982464_397854098526269_4581865977018394136_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HCVpAr0zQF4Q7kNvwFikEMg&_nc_oc=AdqMFfjq0tUwJrn00CJCJZAsoexiMw0yZBEG23-cUirG7OJQqcbckgRJ3pYaCrhSGfA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afwkwy1UqeU8nSn07B8JPCPYI5ZFX1WtfyLi3KSHJ7LFwA&oe=69C126FB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "VR-ME: Fire In The Engine Room", "keywords": [], "long_description": "In the script of the scenario \u00abFire in the Engine Room_VR-ME\u00bb after some welding work in the engine room, a fire starts in the bilge of the engine room, also spreading to the main electrical panel.The \u00abFire in the Engine Room_VR-ME\u00bb app includes actions mentioned below that are urgent at the situation of fire:\n\n-Go to the meeting point. Recount\n\n-Grab, carry and put on \ufb01re \ufb01ghter equipment, prove function     and adjustment\n\n-Grab one \ufb01re extinguisher and put it ready for use.\n\n-Going to the engine control room and trying to su\ufb00ocate the \ufb01re, with a \ufb01re  extinguisher.                          \n\nThe development of the \u00abFire in the Engine Room_VR-ME\u00bb app is co-funded by the Erasmus+ Programme of the European Union under the framework of the Virtual Reality for Maritime Emergencies (VR-ME) project.", "short_description": "\u00abVR-ME: Fire in the Engine Room\u00bb app is about an emergency situation when you\u2019re working onboard a vessel that is out to sea, an engine fire is one of the last things you want to deal with.Engine room fires also obviously put a ship filled with maritime workers at risk of injury or death. The development of the \u00abFire in the Engine Room_VR-ME\u00bb app is co-funded by the Erasmus+ Programme of the European Union under the framework of the Virtual Reality for Maritime Emergencies (VR-ME) project."}]}, "developer_n